Template: ember/erase
Type: string
Description: Type ERASE to install Ember unit ${SERIAL}
 This erases ${DISK} and installs Ember on it. Everything on that disk will be lost.
 .
 Type ERASE (in capitals) and press Enter to continue. Anything else stops the installer without touching the disk.

Template: ember/aborted
Type: error
Description: Installation stopped
 Nothing was written to the disk. Remove the USB stick and turn the machine off.

Template: ember/nodisk
Type: error
Description: No internal disk found
 The installer couldn't find a disk to install Ember on. USB drives are never used.
